`tools/browser/build.mjs` runs `tools/browser/stage-sdl2.py` against the export
runtime after the Wine font overlay. The script updates only the generated
`wine32.zip` and `wine64.zip` copies and records `sdl2-provenance.json` beside
them. `prepare-pages.py` only splits those completed export archives, and
`bw64-build.sh` delegates runtime packaging to `build.mjs`.
